### Connect source control

- [Overview](https://buildkite.com/docs/pipelines/source-control.md): Overview of supported source control integrations and private repository authentication options, including native access for Buildkite hosted agents, SSH keys stored in Buildkite Secrets or on self-hosted agent machines, and GitHub App installation access tokens.
